-- 🔒 Piano Lock v4 — khóa emote + ghi lại sự kiện (gửi log cho tôi)
-- Chạy TRƯỚC khi bật emote (thay cho v3).

local TARGETS = {PianoUI = true}          -- tên GUI của emote
local EMOTE_PAT = {"emote", "piano"}      -- tên script bị khóa
local STOPPRE = {"stop", "cancel", "end", "cleanup", "exit", "finish", "interrupt"}

local Players = game:GetService("Players")
local UIS = game:GetService("UserInputService")
local RS = game:GetService("RunService")
local RepS = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
local lp = Players.LocalPlayer
local pg = lp:WaitForChild("PlayerGui")

local env = (getgenv and getgenv()) or _G
if env.PianoLockCleanup then pcall(env.PianoLockCleanup) end

local S = {lock = true, patch = true, loops = false}
local alive, active, patchTried, msgUntil, lastHide = true, false, false, 0, 0
local T0, T = os.clock(), {}
local learned, disabled, lockLog, lockSeen, frozen = {}, {}, {}, {}, {}
local patched, lastPatchLog, ctrlRef, conns = {}, {}, nil, {}
local myFns = setmetatable({}, {__mode = "k"})
local watched = setmetatable({}, {__mode = "k"})
local soundSeen = {}
local lastEmoteArgs = table.pack(1)
local hookOK = false

local chk = checkcaller or function() return false end
local ncc = newcclosure or function(f) return f end
local clip = setclipboard or toclipboard
local okTb, tb0 = pcall(debug.traceback)
local mine = okTb and tostring(tb0):match("Script '([^']+)'") or nil

local function ev(s)
	T[#T + 1] = ("%7.2f %s"):format(os.clock() - T0, s)
	if #T > 150 then table.remove(T, 1) end
end

local function short(path)
	path = path:gsub("^ReplicatedStorage%.Knit%.Knit%.Services%.", "")
	path = path:gsub("^Workspace%.Characters%.", "WC.")
	return path
end

local function notify(txt)
	pcall(function()
		game:GetService("StarterGui"):SetCore("SendNotification", {Title = "Piano Lock", Text = txt, Duration = 6})
	end)
end

local function ser(v, d)
	d = d or 0
	local t = typeof(v)
	if t == "string" then return '"' .. v:sub(1, 40) .. '"' end
	if t == "Instance" then
		local ok, n = pcall(v.GetFullName, v)
		return ok and short(n) or tostring(v)
	end
	if t == "table" then
		if d > 1 then return "{...}" end
		local p, c = {}, 0
		for k, x in pairs(v) do
			c += 1
			if c > 6 then
				p[#p + 1] = "..."
				break
			end
			p[#p + 1] = tostring(k) .. "=" .. ser(x, d + 1)
		end
		return "{" .. table.concat(p, ", ") .. "}"
	end
	return tostring(v)
end

local function isTarget(inst)
	local ok, r = pcall(function()
		if inst.ClassName == "ScreenGui" then return TARGETS[inst.Name] end
		local p = inst.Parent
		return p ~= nil and p.ClassName == "ScreenGui" and TARGETS[p.Name]
	end)
	return ok and r
end

---------------------------------------------------------------- GHI SỰ KIỆN
local function onRemote(rem, m, a)
	local ok, name = pcall(rem.GetFullName, rem)
	if not ok or name:find("Camera", 1, true) or name:find("AntiCheat", 1, true) then return end
	if m == "FireServer" and name:find("EmoteService.RE.Emote", 1, true) then lastEmoteArgs = a end
	local p = {}
	for i = 1, math.min(a.n, 5) do p[i] = ser(a[i]) end
	ev("→ " .. short(name) .. "(" .. table.concat(p, ", "):sub(1, 70) .. ")")
end

local function onSound(snd, how)
	pcall(function()
		if typeof(snd) ~= "Instance" or snd.ClassName ~= "Sound" then return end
		local id = snd.SoundId:gsub("rbxassetid://", "")
		if id == "5639243489" then return end
		local pn = snd.Parent and snd.Parent:GetFullName() or "nil"
		local myCh = "Workspace.Characters." .. lp.Name
		if pn:sub(1, 21) == "Workspace.Characters." and pn:sub(1, #myCh) ~= myCh then return end
		local key = how .. id .. pn
		local now = os.clock()
		if now - (soundSeen[key] or 0) < 0.2 then return end
		soundSeen[key] = now
		ev("♪ " .. how .. " " .. id .. " @" .. short(pn) .. " spd=" .. ("%.2f"):format(snd.PlaybackSpeed))
	end)
end

local function onHide(why)
	local now = os.clock()
	if now - lastHide < 0.3 then return end
	lastHide = now
	local ok, tb = pcall(debug.traceback)
	if not ok then return end
	task.spawn(function()
		local parts = {}
		for line in tostring(tb):gmatch("[^\n]+") do
			local p, ln = line:match("Script '([^']+)', Line (%d+)")
			if p and p ~= mine then
				learned[p] = true
				if #parts < 5 then parts[#parts + 1] = (p:match("[^%.]+$") or p) .. ":" .. ln end
			end
		end
		ev("⚠ game ẨN/XÓA PianoUI (" .. why .. ") ← " .. table.concat(parts, " < "))
	end)
end

if hookmetamethod and getnamecallmethod then
	hookOK = pcall(function()
		local oldNC, oldNI
		oldNC = hookmetamethod(game, "__namecall", ncc(function(self, ...)
			local m = getnamecallmethod()
			if alive then
				if m == "FireServer" or m == "InvokeServer" then
					task.spawn(onRemote, self, m, table.pack(...))
				elseif m == "Play" then
					task.spawn(onSound, self, "Play")
				elseif m == "PlayLocalSound" then
					task.spawn(onSound, (...), "PlayLocalSound")
				elseif m == "Destroy" or m == "ClearAllChildren" or m == "Remove" then
					if not chk() and isTarget(self) then onHide(m) end
				end
			end
			return oldNC(self, ...)
		end))
		oldNI = hookmetamethod(game, "__newindex", ncc(function(self, k, v)
			if alive then
				if k == "Playing" and v == true then
					task.spawn(onSound, self, "Playing=true")
				elseif (v == false and (k == "Enabled" or k == "Visible")) or (k == "Parent" and v == nil) then
					if not chk() and isTarget(self) then onHide(tostring(k)) end
				end
			end
			return oldNI(self, k, v)
		end))
	end)
end

---------------------------------------------------------------- KHÓA
local function signals(all)
	local L = {}
	local ch = lp.Character
	local h = ch and ch:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
	if h then
		L[#L + 1] = {"Humanoid.Jumping", h.Jumping}
		L[#L + 1] = {"Humanoid.Running", h.Running}
		L[#L + 1] = {"Humanoid.StateChanged", h.StateChanged}
		L[#L + 1] = {"Humanoid.Jump", h:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Jump")}
		L[#L + 1] = {"Humanoid.MoveDirection", h:GetPropertyChangedSignal("MoveDirection")}
	end
	L[#L + 1] = {"UIS.JumpRequest", UIS.JumpRequest}
	if all then
		L[#L + 1] = {"UIS.InputBegan", UIS.InputBegan}
		L[#L + 1] = {"UIS.InputEnded", UIS.InputEnded}
	end
	if all or S.loops then
		L[#L + 1] = {"Heartbeat", RS.Heartbeat}
		L[#L + 1] = {"RenderStepped", RS.RenderStepped}
		L[#L + 1] = {"Stepped", RS.Stepped}
	end
	return L
end

local function scrOf(f)
	local ok, s = pcall(function() return getfenv(f).script end)
	if ok and typeof(s) == "Instance" then return s end
end

local function isTargetScript(s)
	if not s then return false end
	if learned[s:GetFullName()] then return true end
	local n = s.Name:lower()
	for _, p in ipairs(EMOTE_PAT) do
		if n:find(p, 1, true) then return true end
	end
	return false
end

local function scan()
	if not getconnections then return end
	for _, sg in ipairs(signals(false)) do
		local ok, cons = pcall(getconnections, sg[2])
		if ok and type(cons) == "table" then
			for _, c in ipairs(cons) do
				local okf, f = pcall(function() return c.Function end)
				local s = okf and f and not myFns[f] and scrOf(f)
				if s and isTargetScript(s) then
					local en = true
					pcall(function() if c.Enabled == false then en = false end end)
					if en then
						local done = pcall(function() c:Disable() end)
						if not done then done = pcall(function() c:Disconnect() end) end
						if done then
							if #disabled < 300 then disabled[#disabled + 1] = c end
							local line = sg[1] .. " <- " .. s:GetFullName()
							if not lockSeen[line] then
								lockSeen[line] = true
								lockLog[#lockLog + 1] = line
								ev("🔒 khóa " .. line)
							end
						end
					end
				end
			end
		end
	end
end

local function unlock()
	for _, c in ipairs(disabled) do pcall(function() c:Enable() end) end
	disabled = {}
end

local function findController()
	local ps = lp:FindFirstChild("PlayerScripts")
	local m = ps and ps:FindFirstChild("EmoteController", true)
	if m and m:IsA("ModuleScript") then
		local ok, c = pcall(require, m)
		if ok and type(c) == "table" then return c end
	end
end

local function patchStops()
	if patchTried then return end
	patchTried = true
	ctrlRef = ctrlRef or findController()
	if not ctrlRef then
		ev("🩹 không require được EmoteController")
		return
	end
	local names = {}
	pcall(function()
		for k, v in pairs(ctrlRef) do
			if type(k) == "string" and type(v) == "function" then
				local n = k:lower()
				for _, p in ipairs(STOPPRE) do
					if n:sub(1, #p) == p then
						patched[k] = v
						names[#names + 1] = k
						ctrlRef[k] = function()
							local now = os.clock()
							if now - (lastPatchLog[k] or 0) > 0.3 then
								lastPatchLog[k] = now
								ev("⛔ chặn EmoteController." .. k .. "()")
							end
						end
						break
					end
				end
			end
		end
	end)
	ev("🩹 vá: " .. (#names > 0 and table.concat(names, ",") or "(không có hàm Stop nào)"))
end

local function unpatchStops()
	patchTried = false
	if ctrlRef then
		pcall(function()
			for k, v in pairs(patched) do ctrlRef[k] = v end
		end)
	end
	patched = {}
end

---------------------------------------------------------------- THẢ NHÂN VẬT
local function emoteRemotes()
	local list = {}
	for _, d in ipairs(RepS:GetDescendants()) do
		if (d:IsA("RemoteEvent") or d:IsA("UnreliableRemoteEvent")) and d:GetFullName():find("EmoteService", 1, true) then
			list[#list + 1] = d
		end
	end
	return list
end

local function freezeClient()
	for _, r in ipairs(emoteRemotes()) do
		local ok, cons = pcall(getconnections, r.OnClientEvent)
		if ok and type(cons) == "table" then
			for _, c in ipairs(cons) do
				local okf, f = pcall(function() return c.Function end)
				if not (okf and f and myFns[f]) then
					if pcall(function() c:Disable() end) then frozen[#frozen + 1] = c end
				end
			end
		end
	end
	ev("❄ đóng băng " .. #frozen .. " kết nối OnClientEvent của EmoteService")
end

local function unfreeze()
	for _, c in ipairs(frozen) do pcall(function() c:Enable() end) end
	if #frozen > 0 then ev("☀ mở băng " .. #frozen .. " kết nối") end
	frozen = {}
end

local function releaseChar()
	if not getconnections then
		notify("Executor thiếu getconnections")
		return
	end
	freezeClient()
	for _, r in ipairs(emoteRemotes()) do
		if r.Name == "Emote" then
			pcall(function() r:FireServer(table.unpack(lastEmoteArgs, 1, lastEmoteArgs.n)) end)
			ev("🧪 gửi Emote(" .. ser(lastEmoteArgs[1]) .. ") để server tắt pose")
		end
	end
end

---------------------------------------------------------------- THÔNG TIN
local SIGS = {"MouseButton1Down", "MouseButton1Click", "Activated", "TouchTap", "InputBegan"}

local function fnInfo(f)
	local r = {}
	local sc = "?"
	pcall(function() sc = getfenv(f).script:GetFullName() end)
	r[1] = "script=" .. (sc:match("[^%.]+$") or sc)
	pcall(function()
		local i = debug.getinfo(f)
		r[#r + 1] = "L" .. tostring(i.linedefined)
	end)
	pcall(function()
		local cs = {}
		for _, c in pairs(debug.getconstants(f)) do
			if type(c) == "string" and #cs < 15 then cs[#cs + 1] = c:sub(1, 24) end
		end
		r[#r + 1] = "const=" .. table.concat(cs, ",")
	end)
	pcall(function()
		local us = {}
		for i, u in pairs(debug.getupvalues(f)) do
			if #us < 12 then
				local tv = typeof(u)
				if tv == "boolean" or tv == "number" or tv == "string" then
					us[#us + 1] = i .. "=" .. tostring(u):sub(1, 24)
				elseif tv == "Instance" then
					us[#us + 1] = i .. "=" .. u.ClassName .. ":" .. u.Name
				else
					us[#us + 1] = i .. "=<" .. tv .. ">"
				end
			end
		end
		r[#r + 1] = "up=" .. table.concat(us, ",")
	end)
	return r
end

local function handlersInfo(gui, add)
	if not getconnections then
		add("(không có getconnections)")
		return
	end
	local seen, n = {}, 0
	for _, o in ipairs(gui:GetDescendants()) do
		if n >= 4 then break end
		if o:IsA("GuiObject") then
			for _, sig in ipairs(SIGS) do
				local ok, cons = pcall(function() return getconnections(o[sig]) end)
				if ok and type(cons) == "table" then
					for _, c in ipairs(cons) do
						local okf, f = pcall(function() return c.Function end)
						if okf and f and not myFns[f] and not seen[f] and n < 4 then
							seen[f] = true
							n += 1
							add(o.Name .. "." .. sig .. " -> " .. table.concat(fnInfo(f), " | "))
						end
					end
				end
			end
		end
	end
	if n == 0 then add("(không thấy handler)") end
end

local function childNames(inst, limit)
	local t = {}
	if inst then
		for _, d in ipairs(inst:GetChildren()) do
			if #t < limit then t[#t + 1] = d.Name end
		end
	end
	return table.concat(t, ",")
end

local function report()
	local o = {}
	local function add(s) o[#o + 1] = s end
	add(("v4 hook=%s getconn=%s active=%s lock=%s patch=%s"):format(tostring(hookOK), tostring(getconnections ~= nil), tostring(active), tostring(S.lock), tostring(S.patch)))
	add("--- ĐÃ KHÓA ---")
	for _, l in ipairs(lockLog) do add(l) end
	add("--- ĐÃ HỌC ---")
	for p in pairs(learned) do add(p) end
	add("--- SERVICES --- " .. childNames(RepS:FindFirstChild("Services", true), 80))
	local ps = lp:FindFirstChild("PlayerScripts")
	local ctl = ps and ps:FindFirstChild("Controllers")
	local cn = {}
	if ctl then
		for _, d in ipairs(ctl:GetDescendants()) do
			if d:IsA("ModuleScript") and #cn < 100 then cn[#cn + 1] = d.Name end
		end
	end
	add("--- CONTROLLERS --- " .. table.concat(cn, ","))
	add("--- REMOTE EMOTESERVICE ---")
	for _, r in ipairs(emoteRemotes()) do add(r.ClassName .. " " .. short(r:GetFullName())) end
	add("--- EMOTECONTROLLER ---")
	local ctrl = ctrlRef or findController()
	if ctrl then
		ctrlRef = ctrl
		local n = 0
		for k, v in pairs(ctrl) do
			n += 1
			if n > 40 then
				add("...")
				break
			end
			local real = patched[k] or v
			local tv = typeof(real)
			if tv == "function" then
				add("  " .. tostring(k) .. "() " .. table.concat(fnInfo(real), " | "))
			elseif tv == "table" then
				local ks = {}
				for kk in pairs(v) do
					if #ks < 8 then ks[#ks + 1] = tostring(kk) end
				end
				add("  " .. tostring(k) .. " = {" .. table.concat(ks, ",") .. "}")
			else
				add("  " .. tostring(k) .. " = " .. tostring(v):sub(1, 40))
			end
		end
	else
		add("(không require được)")
	end
	add("--- NÚT ĐÀN ---")
	for name in pairs(TARGETS) do
		local g = pg:FindFirstChild(name)
		if g then handlersInfo(g, add) end
	end
	add("--- SCRIPT EMOTE ĐANG NGHE ---")
	if getconnections then
		for _, sg in ipairs(signals(true)) do
			local ok, cons = pcall(getconnections, sg[2])
			if ok and type(cons) == "table" then
				local cnt = 0
				for _, cc in ipairs(cons) do
					local okf, f = pcall(function() return cc.Function end)
					local s = okf and f and not myFns[f] and scrOf(f)
					if s and isTargetScript(s) then cnt += 1 end
				end
				if cnt > 0 then add(sg[1] .. " x" .. cnt) end
			end
		end
	end
	add("--- DÒNG THỜI GIAN ---")
	for _, l in ipairs(T) do add(l) end
	return table.concat(o, "\n")
end

---------------------------------------------------------------- THEO DÕI
local function watchGui(g)
	if watched[g] then return end
	watched[g] = true
	ev("GUI + " .. g.Name)
	table.insert(conns, g:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Enabled"):Connect(function()
		ev(g.Name .. ".Enabled=" .. tostring(g.Enabled))
	end))
	local n = 0
	for _, o in ipairs(g:GetDescendants()) do
		if o:IsA("GuiObject") then
			n += 1
			if n > 150 then break end
			if o.Parent == g then
				table.insert(conns, o:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Visible"):Connect(function()
					ev(g.Name .. "/" .. o.Name .. ".Visible=" .. tostring(o.Visible))
				end))
			end
			table.insert(conns, o.InputBegan:Connect(function(i)
				local t = i.UserInputType
				if t == Enum.UserInputType.Touch or t == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 then
					ev("KEY " .. o.Name .. (o:IsA("TextButton") and (":" .. o.Text) or ""))
				end
			end))
		end
	end
end

local function watchRemote(r)
	if not (r:IsA("RemoteEvent") or r:IsA("UnreliableRemoteEvent")) then return end
	local full = r:GetFullName()
	local l = full:lower()
	if l:find("emote", 1, true) or l:find("piano", 1, true) then
		local f = function(...)
			local a = table.pack(...)
			local p = {}
			for i = 1, math.min(a.n, 5) do p[i] = ser(a[i]) end
			ev("← " .. short(full) .. "(" .. table.concat(p, ", "):sub(1, 70) .. ")")
		end
		myFns[f] = true
		table.insert(conns, r.OnClientEvent:Connect(f))
	end
end

local lastAttr = {}
local function watchChar(ch)
	table.insert(conns, ch.ChildAdded:Connect(function(c) ev("char + " .. c.Name) end))
	table.insert(conns, ch.ChildRemoved:Connect(function(c) ev("char - " .. c.Name) end))
	table.insert(conns, ch.AttributeChanged:Connect(function(a)
		local v = tostring(ch:GetAttribute(a))
		if lastAttr[a] ~= v then
			lastAttr[a] = v
			ev("char@" .. a .. "=" .. v)
		end
	end))
	table.insert(conns, ch.DescendantAdded:Connect(function(d)
		local n = d.Name:lower()
		if n:find("piano", 1, true) or n:find("keyboard", 1, true) then ev("char ++ " .. d.Name) end
	end))
	task.spawn(function()
		local h = ch:WaitForChild("Humanoid", 10)
		if not h then return end
		table.insert(conns, h.StateChanged:Connect(function(_, new) ev("state " .. new.Name) end))
		local an = h:WaitForChild("Animator", 10)
		if an then
			table.insert(conns, an.AnimationPlayed:Connect(function(t)
				local v = t.Priority.Value
				if v >= 2 and v < 1000 then
					local id = tostring(t.Animation and t.Animation.AnimationId):gsub("rbxassetid://", "")
					ev("anim " .. id .. " " .. t.Priority.Name .. " loop=" .. tostring(t.Looped))
				end
			end))
		end
	end)
end

table.insert(conns, UIS.JumpRequest:Connect(function() ev("⤒ JumpRequest") end))
for _, d in ipairs(RepS:GetDescendants()) do watchRemote(d) end
table.insert(conns, RepS.DescendantAdded:Connect(watchRemote))
for _, g in ipairs(pg:GetChildren()) do
	if g:IsA("ScreenGui") and TARGETS[g.Name] then watchGui(g) end
end
table.insert(conns, pg.ChildAdded:Connect(function(g)
	if g:IsA("ScreenGui") then
		ev("GUI + " .. g.Name)
		if TARGETS[g.Name] then watchGui(g) end
	end
end))
table.insert(conns, pg.ChildRemoved:Connect(function(g)
	if g:IsA("ScreenGui") then ev("GUI - " .. g.Name) end
end))
if lp.Character then watchChar(lp.Character) end
table.insert(conns, lp.CharacterAdded:Connect(watchChar))

local function targetGui()
	for name in pairs(TARGETS) do
		local g = pg:FindFirstChild(name)
		if g and g:IsA("ScreenGui") and g.Enabled then return g end
	end
end

task.spawn(function()
	while alive do
		task.wait(0.25)
		if S.lock and targetGui() then
			if not active then
				active = true
				ev("🔒 bắt đầu khóa")
			end
			scan()
			if S.patch then pcall(patchStops) end
		elseif active then
			active = false
			ev("🔓 thôi khóa")
			unlock()
			unpatchStops()
			unfreeze()
		end
	end
end)

